          "en": "partitioning into K clusters"
        },
        {
          "ar": "شجرة تسلسلية كاملة",
          "en": "a hierarchical tree method"
        },
        {
          "ar": "كاشف ضجيج كثيف جداً",
          "en": "a density based noise finder"
        },
        {
          "ar": "نموذج غاوسي مختلط",
          "en": "a Gaussian mixture model"
        }
      ],
      "concept_id": "c8_kmn_type",
      "explanation": {
        "ar": "K-Means خوارزمية تقسيمية إلى K عناقيد.",
        "en": "K-Means is a partitioning algorithm into K clusters."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "stem": {
        "ar": "يُمثَّل كل عنقود K-Means بماذا؟",
        "en": "Each K-Means cluster is represented by what?"
      },
      "bloom": "Remember",
      "answer": 1,
      "options": [
        {
          "ar": "نقطة ضجيج واحدة",
          "en": "a single noise point"
        },
        {
          "ar": "مركزه وهو متوسطه",
          "en": "its centroid the mean"
        },
        {
          "ar": "أكبر عنصر داخله",
          "en": "its largest object"
        },
        {
          "ar": "تسمية فئة معروفة",
          "en": "a known class label"
        }
      ],
      "concept_id": "c8_kmn_centroid",
      "explanation": {
        "ar": "يُمثَّل كل عنقود بمركزه، وهو متوسط عناصره.",
        "en": "Each cluster is represented by its centroid, which is the mean of its objects."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "stem": {
        "ar": "في K-Means، كيف تُسنَد العناصر؟",
        "en": "In K-Means, how are objects assigned?"
      },
      "bloom": "Remember",
      "answer": 2,
      "options": [
        {
          "ar": "تسمية معروفة مسبقاً",
          "en": "a known class label"
        },
        {
          "ar": "الكل إلى عنقود واحد",
          "en": "all to a single cluster"
        },
        {
          "ar": "إلى أقرب مركز له",
          "en": "to the nearest centroid"
        },
        {
          "ar": "إلى أبعد مركز له",
          "en": "to the farthest centroid"
        }
      ],
      "concept_id": "c8_kmn_step3",
      "explanation": {
        "ar": "يُسنَد كل عنصر إلى أقرب مركز، وهذا يشكّل العناقيد.",
        "en": "Each object is assigned to the nearest centroid, which forms the clusters."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q4",
      "stem": {
        "ar": "بعد الإسناد، كيف يُحدَّث المركز؟",
        "en": "After assignment, how is the centroid updated?"
      },
      "bloom": "Remember",
      "answer": 3,
      "options": [
        {
          "ar": "أكبر عنصر داخله",
          "en": "as the largest object"
        },
        {
          "ar": "ثابت لا يتغير أبداً",
          "en": "kept fixed forever more"
        },
        {
          "ar": "تسمية معروفة مسبقاً",
          "en": "as a known class label"
        },
        {
          "ar": "متوسط العناصر كلها",
          "en": "as the mean of objects"
        }
      ],
      "concept_id": "c8_kmn_step4",
      "explanation": {
        "ar": "يُعاد حساب كل مركز كمتوسط العناصر الموجودة الآن في عنقوده.",
        "en": "Each centroid is recomputed as the mean of the objects now in its cluster."
      }
    },
